  "title": "DriveTTO | Search, planning and closed-loop driving",
  "selection": "A 6-minute 36-second introduction: one continuous endpoint-search and dual-planner refinement demonstration, four NAVSIM plans at PDMS 100, and the previously selected ten complete HUGSIM episodes at original speed. Relaxed piano accompanies the film. Method geometry and utility are schematic; scene scores belong to their complete recorded episodes.",
  "note": "Recorded driving retains complete episodes at original playback speed. RC/HD scores describe those complete episodes. Main-video views crop the front camera; gallery videos retain all six views. Schematic method animation is not a measured trajectory. These selected high-score examples are illustrative; aggregate experiment results are unchanged.",
